+5. Fixtures: extend `test/fixtures/base-aave-reserve-params-*.json` with the 3 reserves (incl. eMode categories 7/8/9/1, LT/bonus above) and `test/unit/baseReservePairs.test.ts`, `aaveReservePositionsBonus.test.ts` (eMode bonus 1%/2%/1.25% cases), sizing tests with 18-dec/18-dec pairs (no decimal scaling — different failure mode than USDC/WETH).
+6. Fork test (anvil, keyless — pattern in `test/integration/receiverSweep.fork.test.ts`) of an eMode-8 wstETH/WETH liquidation against a receiver v2 build.
+Effort: config+oracle+fixtures+unit tests ≈ **1–1.5 dev-days**; receiver v2 (per-call fee, new readiness pin, deploy/verify) ≈ **3–5 days** incl. audit-lite + fork proofs; **LIVE benefit is uncertain** — see A1 (thin, low-bonus, big-debt-only).
+
+## B) Sizing the Moonwell rebase (Grok-Work tip `e722227`)
+
+### B1. Lineage
+`Grok-Work` = `31aa6ec` + 9 commits (`0c99138 … e722227`), **without** `78930ac` (stale-critical fix, present on `gw-review` `1860fb0`), `2a8429f` (real debtToCover) or `9b3937b` (sizing follow-ups). Target: `9b3937b` (+ `fix/net-profit-floor`). Merge-base with `9b3937b` is `31aa6ec`.
+
+### B2. Delta to carry (11 files, +620/−38) — [V: `git diff --stat 31aa6ec e722227`]
+| File | Change | Rebase risk vs 9b3937b |
+|---|---|---|
+| `contracts/MultiProtocolFlashReceiver.sol` (+173) | Moonwell liquidate/redeem/wrap route, `authorizedInitiator`, mToken map | none in git (untouched by 9b3937b); **gate for LIVE** (B3) |
+| `src/config/chains.ts` (+71) | extra Base pairs incl. cbETH/weETH/wstETH/EURC/GHO | **CONFLICT** — 9b3937b rewrote Base pairs (`basePair()`, 6 WETH/USDC/cbBTC pairs, `swapFeeTier`) |
+| `src/config/reservePairPolicy.ts` (+43) | `selectBestReservePairForAccount` (config heuristic) | **Conflicts with lesson**: pair must come from on-chain per-reserve positions (`AaveSnapshotProvider`/liquidationSizing) — drop or reduce to Moonwell-only |
+| `src/config/moonwellBase.ts` (+85) | Moonwell Core mToken map | clean add |
+| `src/executors/moonwellLiquidationAdapter.ts` (±20) | quote-based `minCollateralOut` via `estimateMinimumCollateralOut` | **CONFLICT-ish** — 9b3937b rewrote `estimateMinimumCollateralOut` (Aave v3.3 sim, prot. fee, fail-closed undefined); adapter must handle `undefined` |
