+Only **2 files overlap by path** with `31aa6ec..9b3937b` (`chains.ts`, `baseReservePairs.test.ts`) — mechanical rebase is small (~half a day), the substance is B3.
+
+### B3. Gaps vs SLD 7 pre-merge requirements (evidence: `git show e722227:contracts/MultiProtocolFlashReceiver.sol`)
+| SLD-7 item | State at e722227 | Work |
+|---|---|---|
+| **Sweep / rescue** | **No `rescue`/sweep function** (only `setAuthorizedInitiator`, `setMToken`, views). Moonwell route redeems mToken→underlying and can strand tokens/native ETH (`_wrapNativeEth`). | Solidity: add `onlyOwner rescue(token,to,amount)` + ETH rescue. Bot side: `ReceiverSweeper` (this branch) already targets `rescue(address,address,uint256)`; needs the new receiver in its token list + `verifyAuthorization` (works unchanged, receiver has `owner()`). ~1 day incl. tests |
+| **Initiator fail-closed** | `if (authorizedInitiator != address(0) && initiator != authorizedInitiator) revert` → **fail-OPEN when unset (zero)**; constructor/deploy can leave it 0. | Change to `initiator == address(0) || != authorized ⇒ revert`; require non-zero at construction; readiness probe (`eth_call` `authorizedInitiator()`) in `liquidationReceiverReadiness.ts`. ~0.5 day |
+| **minOut math** | `amountOutMinimum = minDebtOut; if 0 → 1` — **caller-supplied, 0 ⇒ 1 wei (no protection)**; encoder uses `estimateMinimumCollateralOut` which returns *collateral*-unit min and was mislabeled as debt-out in the previous impl (fixed in 9b3937b for Aave; Moonwell adapter still consumes it as debtOut — **unit mismatch risk** [U, verify in adapter]). v1 Aave receiver instead computes `need*(1-2%)` on-chain. | Compute minDebtOut on-chain from `owe - debtBal` with slippage bps (as v1), or validate `minDebtOut >= owe*(1-x)`; reject 0. Add fork test with adverse pool state. ~1 day |
+| **Real pair selector** | `selectBestReservePairForAccount` picks from config bonus heuristic (`collateralHeavy ? highest bonus : pair[0]`) — violates "pair from on-chain per-reserve positions only". | Delete for Aave path (9b3937b's `liquidationSizing` planner is the selector); Moonwell needs its own per-market position read (`mToken.balanceOfUnderlying/borrowBalanceStored`, `comptroller.getAccountLiquidity`, close factor, seize via `liquidateCalculateSeizeTokens`). New code ~300–400 LOC + tests, **2–3 days** |
+| **Build artifacts** | `contracts/build/*.json` are tracked in `e722227` **and were deleted in the `sizingfix` worktree** (`git status` shows `D`). Readiness code-hash pin is for v1 only. | Rebuild via `npm run compile:contracts`, commit artifacts with recorded solc version/optimizer, add MultiProtocol runtime code-hash pin. ~0.5 day |
+| **Receiver layout verify** | v1 readiness = code hash + 5-field layout probe. Multi-protocol uses a **different params layout** (`routeType, collateral, debt, user, debtToCover, minCollateralOut, receiveAToken` = 7 fields) and `receiverVersion` (not to be trusted per lesson). | Extend `assertLiquidationReceiverReadiness` with a per-receiver-kind code-hash + layout probe (decode a canned 7-field payload via `eth_call` to executeOperation with bad caller expecting `OnlyPool`/`UnauthorizedInitiator`). ~1 day |
+| **78930ac lineage** | Grok-Work lacks `78930ac` (fresh HF<1 arms pipeline despite stale-critical) and `2a8429f`/`9b3937b`. | Rebase onto `9b3937b` (which already includes 78930ac via `2a8429f`←`78930ac`) — resolves automatically; re-run its tests. 0 extra |
+
+### B4. Effort (concrete)
+| Work item | Files/areas | Estimate |
+|---|---|---|
+| Mechanical rebase onto new tip; resolve `chains.ts`, `baseReservePairs.test.ts`, `moonwellLiquidationAdapter.ts` | 3 files | 0.5 d |
+| Drop config pair heuristic; Moonwell per-market position read + pair selector | new `moonwellPositions.ts`, adapter, `index.ts` wiring | 2–3 d |
+| Receiver Solidity: rescue, fail-closed initiator, on-chain minOut; rebuild artifacts | `MultiProtocolFlashReceiver.sol`, `contracts/build/*`, compile script | 1.5–2 d |
+| Readiness/layout/code-hash for multi-protocol receiver | `liquidationReceiverReadiness.ts` + tests | 1 d |
+| Sweep + net-profit floor integration for Moonwell candidates (Moonwell flash premium/bonus/close-factor inputs, no missing-input silent pass) | `liquidationCandidateGate.ts` inputs, sweeper token list | 1 d |
+| Fork proofs (historical block 50623620 + adverse-slippage + non-owner/initiator cases) | `test/integration/*moonwell*` | 1–1.5 d |
+| **Total** | | **≈ 7–9 dev-days** (+ deploy/verify/soak, not counted) |
+
+Recommendation: do **not** merge `Grok-Work` wholesale. Cherry-pick `moonwellBase.ts`, `moonwellRouteEncoding` tests and the receiver route as a *new* branch after the Solidity gaps above are closed; keep `ENABLE_NON_AAVE_LIQUIDATION=false` until receiver v-next is deployed, code-hash pinned and fork-proven.
